From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:34:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add an Analysis settings category with animation controls

Persist an animateStatistics preference (default on) through the existing
DataStore, repository, use-case and view-model chain. Settings gains an
Analysis category between Display and About with a switch for the animation
and an About analysis history dialog explaining that the local SQLite history
never leaves the device.
